From: Justin <justurn@live.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Feb 2026 02:36:24 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] I-122: Move vanilla_item_changes.sql to optional

Prevents auto-import of vanilla item restorations that downgrade
144 dungeon weapons/armor (e.g. Thornspike, Rhahk'Zor's Hammer)
from their WotLK quality/stats to inferior vanilla versions.

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .../sql/world/zz_optional_vanilla_item_changes.sql                | 0
 1 file changed, 0 insertions(+), 0 deletions(-)
 rename data/sql/db-world/base/vanilla_item_changes.sql => optional/sql/world/zz_optional_vanilla_item_changes.sql (100%)

diff --git a/data/sql/db-world/base/vanilla_item_changes.sql b/optional/sql/world/zz_optional_vanilla_item_changes.sql
similarity index 100%
rename from data/sql/db-world/base/vanilla_item_changes.sql
rename to optional/sql/world/zz_optional_vanilla_item_changes.sql
